                                                "sense_id": "59eceb23-2496-3c12-8363-80642e84af0c",
                                                "text": "In January, Boko Haram struck Fotokol, a Cameroonian town separated by only a bridge from Gambarou, Nigeria, a stronghold of the Islamist extremists. The attackers killed more than 400 people."
